Error: Jet.ValueTypeMismatch: `1.5` isn't a whole number, so `Int` can't hold it exactly
  --> http_route_path_type_rule_order.jet:40:16
    |
 40 |     first: Int{1.5}
    |                ^^^
 Why: An integer typed literal converts a Float only when no rounding is needed; it never picks a rounding for you
 Fix: Round it first, as in `Int{math.trunc(value)}`, or with `math.floor`, `math.ceil`, `math.round` or `math.round_even`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.ValueTypeMismatch

Error: Jet.RouteMethodTokenRefused: HTTPRouter custom route method must be a static String
  --> http_route_path_type_rule_order.jet:45:19
    |
 45 |     router.custom(verb, "/files/:name", named)
    |                   ^^^^
 Why: Router and `#Server.Custom` routes are fully checked while building; only an App takes a run-time method, checked when it registers
 Fix: Use a literal or compile-time String constant, or register the route on a `web.app()`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.RouteMethodTokenRefused

