Error: http_route_path_type_rule_order.Fraction: A gauge reads whole numbers
  --> http_route_path_type_rule_order.jet:49:22
    |
 49 |     print(gauge.read(2.5))
    |                      ^^^
 Why: The gauge rule hears each argument's type
 Fix: Pass an Int

